--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Formats implemented without third-party code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Datarium reads the resource pack formats defined by OptiFine (sp614x), CIT Resewn
(SHsuperCM, https://github.com/SHsuperCM/CITResewn) and Respackopts (JFronny,
https://git.frohnmeyer-wds.de/JfMods/Respackopts). These features are independent
implementations; no verbatim code from those projects is included. The only file
shared with them is the configure button texture credited above.

